    "Score the following translation of readme file from English to German on a continuous scale from 0 to 100, where a score of zero means \"no meaning preserved\" and score of one hundred means \"perfect meaning and grammar\".\n",
    "# 🦜️🔗 LangChain\n",
    "\n",
    "⚡ Baue kontextbewusste, reasoning-basierte Anwendungen ⚡\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Release Notes](https://img.shields.io/github/release/langchain-ai/langchain?style=flat-square)](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/releases)\n",
    "[![CI](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/actions/workflows/check_diffs.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/actions/workflows/check_diffs.yml)\n",
    "[![PyPI - Lizenz](https://img.shields.io/pypi/l/langchain-core?style=flat-square)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)\n",
    "[![PyPI - Downloads](https://img.shields.io/pypi/dm/langchain-core?style=flat-square)](https://pypistats.org/packages/langchain-core)\n",
    "[![GitHub Sterne](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/langchain-ai/langchain?style=flat-square)](https://star-history.com/#langchain-ai/langchain)\n",
    "[![Offene Issues](https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/langchain-ai/langchain?style=flat-square)](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues)\n",
    "[![Öffnen in Dev Containers](https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Dev%20Containers&message=Open&color=blue&logo=visualstudiocode&style=flat-square)](https://vscode.dev/redirect?url=vscode://ms-vscode-remote.remote-containers/cloneInVolume?url=https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain)\n",
    "[![Öffnen in GitHub Codespaces](https://github.com/codespaces/badge.svg)](https://codespaces.new/langchain-ai/langchain)\n",
    "[![Twitter](https://img.shields.io/twitter/url/https/twitter.com/langchainai.svg?style=social&label=Folgen%20%40LangChainAI)](https://twitter.com/langchainai)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Schnelle Installation\n",
    "\n",
    "Mit pip:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install langchain\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Mit conda:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "conda install langchain -c conda-forge\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🤔 Was ist LangChain?\n",
    "\n",
    "**LangChain** ist ein Framework zur Entwicklung von Anwendungen, die durch große Sprachmodelle (LLMs) unterstützt werden.\n",
    "\n",
    "LangChain vereinfacht den gesamten Lebenszyklus dieser Anwendungen:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Open-Source-Bibliotheken**: Erstelle Anwendungen mit den [Komponenten](https://python.langchain.com/docs/concepts/) und [Integrationen](https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/providers/) von LangChain.\n",
    "- **Produktionsreife**: Überwache und optimiere deine Anwendungen mit [LangSmith](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/).\n",
    "- **Bereitstellung**: Veröffentliche APIs und Assistenten mit der [LangGraph Platform](https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/cloud/).\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🧱 Was kannst du mit LangChain bauen?\n",
    "\n",
    "**❓ Fragebeantwortung mit RAG**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Dokumentation](https://python.langchain.com/docs/tutorials/rag/)\n",
    "\n",
    "**🧱 Strukturierte Ausgabe extrahieren**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Dokumentation](https://python.langchain.com/docs/tutorials/extraction/)\n",
    "\n",
    "**🤖 Chatbots**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Dokumentation](https://python.langchain.com/docs/tutorials/chatbot/)\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🚀 Wie hilft LangChain?\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Komponenten**: Modular und einfach zu verwenden.\n",
    "2. **Einfache Orchestrierung mit LangGraph**: Baue produktionsreife Anwendungen.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Komponenten\n",
    "\n",
    "**📃 Modell I/O**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Prompt-Verwaltung](https://python.langchain.com/docs/concepts/prompt_templates/)\n",
    "- [Chat-Modelle](https://python.langchain.com/docs/concepts/chat_models/)\n",
    "\n",
    "**📚 Retrieval**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Daten laden](https://python.langchain.com/docs/concepts/document_loaders/)\n",
    "\n",
    "**🤖 Agenten**\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Anpassbare Agenten](https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/tutorials/)\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📚 Dokumentation\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Einleitung](https://python.langchain.com/docs/introduction/)\n",
    "- [Tutorials](https://python.langchain.com/docs/tutorials/)\n",
    "- [How-to Guides](https://python.langchain.com/docs/how_to/)\n",
    "- [Konzeptuelle Erklärungen](https://python.langchain.com/docs/concepts/)\n",
    "- [API-Referenz](https://python.langchain.com/api_reference/)\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🌐 Ökosystem\n",
    "\n",
    "- [LangSmith](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/)\n",
    "- [LangGraph](https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/)\n",
    "\n",
